# The docker images' pinned rust:1-slim-* toolchain is authoritative in
# containers. If this file reaches the build context, rustup sees
# channel = "stable" as a *different* toolchain than the image's
# version-named one and freshly installs it mid-build — after the
# builder stage already added the cross target to the image toolchain,
# breaking aarch64 (E0463: can't find crate for `std`) and silently
# discarding the cargo-chef dependency cache.
